    "name": "Continuum — Session 7",
    "description": "API-22: Refresh Tokens (Multi-Device Auth).\n\nRun order: 1. Login → 2. Refresh → 3. Logout → 4. Logout All → 5. Error Cases.\nrefreshToken is auto-set by test scripts.",
